  "evidenceBasisLegend": {
    "SELF_CONTAINED": "The gold behaviour is derivable from the synthetic material carried inside the record itself. No external authority is required to know the answer is right. Such records may reach candidate and, after human content review, human_reviewed.",
    "EXTERNAL_AUTHORITY": "The gold behaviour asserts something about the world (a regulation, a code set, a payer rule, a clinical threshold). It cannot rise above candidate_needs_source_verification until a registered human opens the cited source."
